<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-004-AD35>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-004-AD35" ;
  triage:title "5 named Exact Target docs still describe pre-AD.31 model with zero peek content" ;
  triage:description "The following 5 named Exact Target docs still describe the pre-AD.31 messaging model and contain zero content about the peek surface introduced in AD.31: docs/atm/requirements.md, docs/atm/architecture.md, docs/atm-core/requirements.md, docs/atm-core/architecture.md, docs/architecture.md. These should have been updated to reflect the AD.31 peek surface and owner-only mutation reset but were not." ;
